#. i18n: file ./firstrunwizard.ui line 38
#: rc.cpp:51
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<h1>Welcome!</h1>\n"
"<p>There are many media-players around these days, this is true. But what's "
"missing from most players is an interface that doesn't get in your way. How "
"many buttons do you have to press when simply adding media to the playlist? "
"amaroK tries to be a little different, providing a simple drag-and-drop "
"interface that makes playlist handling really easy.</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><i>\"amaroK is seriously super!\"</i> - Uncle Rodney</p>\n"
"<h2>First-run Wizard</h2>\n"
"<p>This wizard will help you setup amaroK in three easy steps. Click "
"<i>Next</i> to begin, or if you do not like wizards, click <i>Skip</i>.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file ./firstrunwizard.ui line 84
#: rc.cpp:58
#, no-c-format
msgid "[1] Interface"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file ./firstrunwizard.ui line 126
#: rc.cpp:62
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Separate player and playlist-windows\n"
"(like XMMS)"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file ./firstrunwizard.ui line 147
#: rc.cpp:66
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Single window with player and playlist\n"
"functionality combined\n"
"(like JuK)"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file ./firstrunwizard.ui line 176
#: rc.cpp:71
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<p>"
"With amaroK you can use the interface that you find most comfortable. The "
"choices are listed below and an example screenshot is shown on their right. "
"You can change these settings at a later time using the amaroK configuration "
"dialog.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file ./firstrunwizard.ui line 233
#: rc.cpp:75
#, no-c-format
msgid "[2] Collection"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file ./firstrunwizard.ui line 249
#: rc.cpp:78
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<p>Your <b>Collection</b>"
" is a database of media, with which you can quickly and easily find your "
"music using queries based on the media's tags.</p>\n"
"<p>Here you should select which folders to search for media, amaroK will "
"begin the search when this wizard is complete. If you choose to <i>Monitor "
"Changes</i>, amaroK will be notified when changes are made to the contents "
"of these folders and will update the Collection accordingly.</p>\n"
"<p>You can change the configuration of the Collection at a future time from "
"the <i>Actions</i> menu in the <b>Collection-browser</b>.</p>"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file ./firstrunwizard.ui line 259
#: rc.cpp:83
#, no-c-format
msgid "[3] Finish"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: file ./firstrunwizard.ui line 324
#: rc.cpp:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<h1>Congratulations!</h1>\n"
"<p>amaroK is ready for use! When you click finish amaroK will appear and "
"begin scanning the folders in your collection.</p>\n"
"<p>amaroK's Playlist-window will show your <b>Collection</b>"
" on the left and the <b>Playlist</b> on the right. Drag and drop music from "
"the Collection to the Playlist and press <b>Play</b>.</p>\n"
"<p>If you want more help or a tutorial, please check out the <a "
"href=\"help:/amarok\">amaroK handbook</a>. We hope you enjoy using "
"amaroK.</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\">The amaroK developers</p>"
msgstr ""

